{"id": 4889, "title": "Dancing", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "dancing", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/4889_dancing.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["张老师最近有了一个新学生，她是个八岁的小女孩，她的妈妈带着她来学跳舞。上课一个月以后，老师发现这个女孩每次上课都不笑。原来是这个女孩的妈妈逼她来学跳舞，但是小女孩不喜欢。老师问这个妈妈为什么一定要让孩子学跳舞？这个妈妈说，因为她从小就觉得会跳舞的人都很美，所以想让孩子来学。老师说：那么下次孩子就不用来了，她不喜欢，也不快乐，喜欢跳舞的是你，你才应该来当我的学生。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["張老師最近有了一個新學生，她是個八歲的小女孩，她的媽媽帶著她來學跳舞。上課一個月以後，老師發現這個女孩每次上課都不笑。原來是這個女孩的媽媽逼她來學跳舞，但是小女孩不喜歡。老師問這個媽媽為什麼一定要讓孩子學跳舞？這個媽媽說，因為她從小就覺得會跳舞的人都很美，所以想讓孩子來學。老師說：那麼下次孩子就不用來了，她不喜歡，也不快樂，喜歡跳舞的是你，你才應該來當我的學生。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["Zhāng lǎo shī zuì jìn yǒu le yī gè xīn xué shēng， tā shì gè bā suì de xiǎo nǚ hái， tā de mā ma dài zhe tā lái xué tiào wǔ。 shàng kè yī gè yuè yǐ hòu， lǎo shī fā xiàn zhè gè nǚ hái měi cì shàng kè dōu bù xiào。 yuán lái shì zhè gè nǚ hái de mā ma bī tā lái xué tiào wǔ， dàn shì xiǎo nǚ hái bù xǐ huan。 lǎo shī wèn zhè gè mā ma wèi shén me yī dìng yào ràng hái zi xué tiào wǔ？ zhè gè mā ma shuō， yīn wèi tā cóng xiǎo jiù jué de huì tiào wǔ de rén dōu hěn měi， suǒ yǐ xiǎng ràng hái zi lái xué。 lǎo shī shuō： nà me xià cì hái zi jiù bù yòng lái le， tā bù xǐ huan， yě bù kuài lè， xǐ huan tiào wǔ de shì nǐ， nǐ cái yīng gāi lái dāng wǒ de xué shēng。"], "english_paragraphs": ["Teacher Zhang recently had a new student. She is an eight-year-old girl. Her mother took her to learn to dance. After a month of class, the teacher discovered that the girl never smiled every time she attended class. It turned out that the girl's mother forced her to learn dancing, but the little girl didn't like it. The teacher asked this mother why she had to let her child learn to dance? The mother said that since she was a child, she thought people who could dance were beautiful, so she wanted her children to learn. The teacher said: Then the child will not come next time. She does not like it and is not happy. It is you who likes to dance, and you should be my student."], "english_full": "Teacher Zhang recently had a new student. She is an eight-year-old girl. Her mother took her to learn to dance. After a month of class, the teacher discovered that the girl never smiled every time she attended class. It turned out that the girl's mother forced her to learn dancing, but the little girl didn't like it. The teacher asked this mother why she had to let her child learn to dance? The mother said that since she was a child, she thought people who could dance were beautiful, so she wanted her children to learn. The teacher said: Then the child will not come next time. She does not like it and is not happy. It is you who likes to dance, and you should be my student.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Zhāng\" data-defn=\"surname Zhang\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">张</span><span class=\"tr\">張</span><rt>Zhāng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lǎo shī\" data-defn=\"teacher\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">老师</span><span class=\"tr\">老師</span><rt>lǎo shī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zuì jìn\" data-defn=\"recently\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">最近</span><span class=\"tr\">最近</span><rt>zuì jìn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xīn\" data-defn=\"new; newly\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">新</span><span class=\"tr\">新</span><rt>xīn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xué shēng\" data-defn=\"student / schoolchild\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">学生</span><span class=\"tr\">學生</span><rt>xué shēng</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"she\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">她</span><span class=\"tr\">她</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bā\" data-defn=\"eight\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">八</span><span class=\"tr\">八</span><rt>bā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"suì\" data-defn=\"classifier for years (of age)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">岁</span><span class=\"tr\">歲</span><rt>suì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎo\" data-defn=\"young\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">小</span><span class=\"tr\">小</span><rt>xiǎo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǚ hái\" data-defn=\"girl; lass\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">女孩</span><span class=\"tr\">女孩</span><rt>nǚ hái</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā de\" data-defn=\"her; hers\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">她的</span><span class=\"tr\">她的</span><rt>tā de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"mā ma\" data-defn=\"mama / mommy / mother\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\